# Regression test blocklist for the pinned prebuilt x86_64 Linux 6.16.0 VM.
# One executable path per line, relative to `/test` in the guest.
# Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.

## Missing `CONFIG_EXFAT_FS` in the kernel image (no mounted `/exfat`)
fs/empty_write/empty_write
fs/exfat/read_eof
fs/fdatasync/fdatasync
fs/statx/btime

## Missing `CONFIG_EXT2_FS_XATTR` in the kernel image
fs/ext2/xattr

